sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Researcher
  participant UI as DSH web UI
  participant A as Academic Harness agent
  participant T as Preset tools
  participant P as External provider
  participant W as Workspace and memory

  U->>UI: Ask a research question
  UI->>A: Prompt + preset context
  A->>T: literature_search / openalex_search / consensus_search
  T->>P: REST or MCP request
  P-->>T: Normalized records
  T-->>A: Ranked results with stable identifiers
  A->>T: paper_resolve + integrity_check
  T-->>A: One identity + publication status
  A->>W: paper_download → PaperMemory ingest
  A->>T: quote_check / trace
  T-->>A: Verbatim evidence + provenance
  A-->>UI: Answer with verified citations
  A->>W: notebook entry / scientific_result
